# Meld fork local scratch: planning docs, audits, PR drafts, and release-note drafts.
# These are never released. Release notes are pasted into the GitHub Release UI by hand.
# Only CHANGELOG.md + README.md (+ CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md) are kept docs.
/RELEASE-2.*.md
/RELEASE-NOTES-*.md
/PLAN-*.md
/FORK-AUDIT.md
/UPSTREAM-PRS.md
/pr-body.md
/CHANGELOG-meld-seam.md
/docs/meld-fork/

